$*************HEADING****************************************
$
PROJ 'a11refr' 'A11'
$
$ PURPOSE OF TEST: Test of the refraction formulation
$
$ --|--------------------------------------------------------------|--
$   | This SWAN input file is part of the bench mark tests for     |
$   | SWAN.                                                        |
$ --|--------------------------------------------------------------|--
$
$***********MODEL INPUT**************************************
$
$CGRID 295668.0 191709.0 0. 55000.00 52000.00 100 100 CIRCLE 36 0.0521 1. 31

CGRID UNSTRUCTURED CIRCLE 36 0.0521 1. 31
READ UNSTRUCTURED triangle 'TEST.4'

$
$INPgrid BOTtom REGular 295668.0 191709.0 0. 249 249 220. 208. EXCeption 999999.00
$READinp BOTtom -1. 'clippedbathy_250_250.csv' 4 FREE

INPgrid BOTtom REGular 295668.0 191709.0 0. 999 999 55. 55. EXCeption 999999.00
READinp BOTtom -1. 'clippedbathy_1000_1000.csv' 4 FREE


$
BOUN SHAPE JON 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES 
$BOUN SIDE N CONST PAR 2.2 12 110 30 
BOUN SIDE 102 CONST PAR 2.2 12 110 30 
$BOUN SIDE W CONST PAR 0.3 20 45 30 
$BOUN SIDE S CONST PAR 2.2 12 110 30
$

WIND 15 0 

GEN3 JANSSEN 4.5 0.5 AGROW 0.003
QUAD
BREA
WCAP
$
$************ OUTPUT REQUESTS *************************
$
$
$*************************************************************
BLOCK  'COMPGRID' NOHEAD 'Wind_w_ha3.vtu' LAYOUT 3 XP YP BOTLEV WATLEV DEPTH HS TM01 DSPR PDIR VEL FRCOEFF TPS URMS
$
$ set itest=1 in order to get detailed information in PRINT file
TEST 1,0
COMPUTE
STOP


